Package: bluedb
Type: Package
Title: Access the BLUE_DB Local-Level European Election Database
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("François", "Hublet", email = "francois.hublet@protonmail.ch",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Nicola", "Chiecchio", role = "aut"))
Description: R interface to BLUE_DB (Basic Local Units Election Database):
    municipality-level results of national parliamentary and European
    Parliament elections across Europe, joinable to Eurostat geodata via
    GISCO identifiers and to the party-politics literature via Party Facts
    identifiers.  Loads and filters elections, aggregates results to NUTS
    levels and party families, and resolves the boundary polygon of every
    reporting unit.  Functionally identical to the 'blue_db' Python package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://electionatlas.eu, https://github.com/blue-electoral-bulletin/BLUE_DB
BugReports: https://github.com/blue-electoral-bulletin/BLUE_DB/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    utils,
    stats
